OL,3,ATwo men die in Channel crossing attempt
OL,4,Aoff northern France
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have died after trying to cross
OL,7,Fthe English Channel off the coast of
OL,8,FBerck in northern France.
OL,10,FAccording to local media, police saw
OL,11,Fmigrants leaving the beach on a boat at
OL,12,Fabout 22:00 local time on Sunday, and
OL,13,Fwhen rescuers arrived, they were
OL,14,Fbailing water out of the overloaded
OL,15,Fvessel with their shoes.
OL,17,F"When we arrived, there were at least
OL,18,F80 people on board and a terrible smell
OL,19,Fof gasoline,"Jean-Marc Lamblin,
OL,20,Fdirector of the French national sea
OL,21,Frescue service (SNSM) told La Voix du
OL,22,FNord newspaper.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
