OL,3,ATwo men die in Channel crossing attempt
OL,4,Aoff northern France
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo women were taken to hospital after
OL,7,Fsuffering burns that were caused by the
OL,8,Fmixture of gasoline in the seawater.
OL,9,FTheir condition has been described as
OL,10,Fnot life-threatening.
